This file marks the folder it is in as a Formulize embed theme.

It keeps the theme out of the pickers where it would make no sense - the site theme, the admin
theme, the per-screen template theme - and puts it into the one where it does: the "Theme for
embedded screens" preference. A theme needs a theme.html file to work at all, and that file is what
puts a folder in the theme list, so the marker is what tells the two kinds of theme apart.

If you copy this folder to design your own embedded appearance, keep this file.
